{"words": [{"text": "وَلَن", "translation": "And never (will)"}, {"text": "يَتَمَنَّوْهُ", "translation": "they wish for it"}, {"text": "أَبَدًۢا", "translation": "ever"}, {"text": "بِمَا", "translation": "because"}, {"text": "قَدَّمَتْ", "translation": "(of what) sent ahead"}, {"text": "أَيْدِيهِمْ ۗ", "translation": "their hands"}, {"text": "وَٱللَّهُ", "translation": "And Allah"}, {"text": "عَلِيمٌۢ", "translation": "(is) All-Knower"}, {"text": "بِٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ", "translation": "of the wrongdoers"}], "sahih": "But never will they wish for it, ever, because of what their hands have put forth. And Allāh is Knowing of the wrongdoers."}